<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Resources 6-mth net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Resources 6-mth net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     65.61	 vs	  25.11</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents) 12.0	  vs	   5.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		481.56	 vs	 418.57</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	147.93	 vs	  91.60</p>
<p>    Minorities   less    28.21	 vs  less  22.14</p>
<p>NOTE -- Malaysian Resources Corporation Bhd is involved in construction, media and financial services businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
